5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious which of these records you think will actually change our minds before we vote.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the roster books. We keep promising services we can’t staff. Who else is checking the crew numbers?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m leaning toward the journey audits. I want to see where the minutes actually go, not just where the complaints land.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I’d like to check the joint operators' committee minutes. I need to know who else must agree before we can promise a single date.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’m drawn to the capital ledger balances. I want to see what we’re truly committed to paying in the years after the headline totals.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,I’m picking the two pilots from eight years ago. I want to see what actually happened last time before we get excited again.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll check the crew establishment and maintenance contract. I need to know if we have spare capacity or if we’re just borrowing from the future.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I’ll also look into the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city. I need to verify if the crowding is real or just a perception.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I’ll also look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells. I need to know what the ground might hide before we trust any delivery date.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll also check the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates. I need to see if the recurring costs are quietly eating the capital we think we have.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I’m done. Let’s see what the dust reveals.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll pass. Let’s see what the records actually say before we start guessing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll pass. Let’s see what the records actually say before we start guessing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
